# ==============================================================================
# File .env DIGGO Miner
# Cukup tempelkan string initData (user=...&hash=...) langsung di berkas ini.
# Tanpa perlu awalan INIT_DATA= dan tanpa perlu pengaturan Base URL / proxy di sini.
# ==============================================================================

# Akun 1:
user=%7B%22id%22%3A123456789%2C%22first_name%22%3A%22Demo%22%2C%22username%22%3A%22demo_user%22%7D&chat_instance=1234567890&chat_type=sender&auth_date=1728000000&hash=abcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890

